{"Title":"An Act to support communities and immigrants","BillNumber":"S363","DocketNumber":"SD2412","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T17:00:07.09"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"JCV0","Name":"John C. Velis","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JCV0","ResponseDate":"2023-01-20T17:00:07.12"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/S363/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Mr. Velis, a petition (accompanied by bill, Senate, No. 363) of John C. Velis for legislation to support communities and immigrants.  Education.","DocumentText":"\tChapter 18 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2022 official edition, is hereby amended by adding the following section:- \r\n\tSection 40. An Act Relative to Educational Funding \r\n\t(a) The department of education shall establish an assistance program to ensure municipalities that are experiencing sudden influxes of immigrant populations.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J14","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J14"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}